```

Vulnerable Function Found:
```
static void time2str(char *r, curl_off_t seconds)
{
  curl_off_t h;
  if(seconds <= 0) {
    strcpy(r, "--:--:--");  // ⚠️ VULNERABLE LINE 94
    return;
  }
  h = seconds / 3600;
  // ... rest of function
}
```

